# EvoGen project rules

- Product docs: `docs/plano-conceitual-evogen.md` (intent) + English `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` / `GLOSSARY.md`.
- Delivery order: phases 03–04 (C++ core + DirectLearner) done; HTTP/UI starts at phase 05+.
- Domain terms only from `docs/GLOSSARY.md` — never call evolutionary individuals “coding agents”.
- Experiment semantics from `docs/EXPERIMENTAL-DESIGN.md` (conditions A/B/C; T1 XOR/sine).
- Caps: ≤80 lines/function, ≤200 lines/file, cyclomatic ≤10; run `npm run verify`.
- Implementation checklists live in `.local/phases/*/TASKS.md` (gitignored).
